WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Record the exact list and the authority
that maintains it.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.440
Write down the names and identifiers you
searched and the date you searched them.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:15.080
Describe the result within the scope of
that search. Link to the list so readers
can check it themselves.
